<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 6.601 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 6.601 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 6.601 billion pesos from the secondary market on Thursday through six auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>1.100 bln  8 days</p>
<p>1.100 bln  7 days</p>
<p>1.100 bln  6 days</p>
<p>1.100 bln  5 days</p>
<p>1.100 bln  4 days</p>
<p>1.101 bln  1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
